# Re-include docs/ tree — bundled into the image and consumed by the
# helper-bot corpus loader (packages/backend/src/services/helper-bot/
# corpus-loader.ts). Without this, *.md above strips every doc and the
# bot ships with an empty system prompt.
!docs
!docs/**
